# [EXTERNAL] User-Agent Kayak requires on every search call. Must be "kayakaffiliateapp" (or an approved browser UA) or Kayak returns 400 INVALID_USER_AGENT.
KAYAK_USER_AGENT=kayakaffiliateapp
